tinker_cookbook.distillation.train_on_policy:201 [[92mINFO[0m] <|im_system|>system<|im_middle|>You are Kimi, an AI assistant created by Moonshot AI.<|im_end|><|im_user|>user<|im_middle|>Help me come up with a witty reply to a coworker who always microwaves fish.<|im_end|><|im_assistant|>assistant<|im_middle|><think></think>Ah yes, the office fish-microwaver—truly the apex predator of workplace social dynamics. Here are a few options, calibrated by how much you enjoy currently having a job:

